| `approved_before_purchase` | approval timestamp before purchase | high | {{ exceptions.by_check_name.approved_before_purchase? | int }} |
| `carrier_before_purchase` | handed to carrier before purchase | high | {{ exceptions.by_check_name.carrier_before_purchase? | int }} |
| `delivered_before_purchase` | delivered before purchase | high | {{ exceptions.by_check_name.delivered_before_purchase? | int }} |
